# PLO_GANISCRIPT (134) forged by the probe: a compiled GS2 body (from the gs1-on-gs2 kit) sent as the script of a gani,
# behind PLO_RAWDATA, with the server's own 195 dropped. Does it change the fallback, or make the client fetch the gani?
waitsession 240
wait s2c 9 90
sleep 8
drop s2c 195
mark G1 GANISCRIPT for probes2 (file SETBACKTO sit), then play it
s2c 100 i3:200 | 134 hex:
sleep 1
s2c 9 c:10 str:probes2
sleep 5
mark G2 GANISCRIPT for jhammer, never used: does the client fetch it?
s2c 100 i3:200 | 134 hex:
sleep 4
mark G3 then play jhammer
s2c 9 c:10 str:jhammer
sleep 5
mark END
sleep 2
